SY_TALK("Q2yFKhj5_1E",[[3,["Now. (Hindi aside)"]],[12,["So. Now to, you see, to influence other","people we must know"]],[15,["how much control we have upon ourselves","also; that’s very important."]],[20,["For example, some people, you see,","have no proper image"]],[27,["and they try to influence others, so it’s","a mockery."]],[30,["Nobody gets influenced by such a person","who himself has no image of his own."]],[39,["So, before working out the exterior,","interior must be worked out."]],[44,["For example, a person who always comes","late to the office,"]],[48,["and is always delayed and has no","time-sense, is never respected."]],[56,["So when you tell people that “you should","be in time”,"]],[59,["you should be the first to arrive","at the time, right time."]],[61,["You must always keep the time, absolutely,"]],[64,["you should be known person for keeping","time."]],[67,["Say, supposing you have to go to the office","at say ten o’clock,"]],[72,["you reach office in such a way that you are","there five minutes, wait outside"]],[77,["and enter the office exactly at the time","when you have to go."]],[83,["That punctuality is very important. That","helps people,"]],[87,["and people get an awe about you because","they think that"]],[91,["“This gentleman is so regular and I’m","the one who is absolutely late”."]],[97,["Also, if you tell somebody that I have","to meet at such and such a time,"]],[101,["and should be arranged at such and such","a time,"]],[106,["then you should be absolutely punctual."]],[109,["That is very important, that the punctuality","is to be maintained by you."]],[116,["Now, I’ve seen in the West specially that","people get up very late"]],[125,["and they are very lazy. They walk","in a limpy manner;"]],[129,["and the whole thing shows that, you see,","they are not interested in the world."]],[134,["They are just pushed into it; somehow","or other they are doing it."]],[137,["Such a person can never influence anyone,","because people also see your image,"]],[142,["that you yourself you are dragging your","life somehow;"]],[145,["so why to do the same thing, whatever he is","doing he cannot tell us anything."]],[150,["So that’s another reason you cannot","influence people at all,"]],[153,["if you are yourself a lazy person."]],[157,["So the person who has to influence others","has to be early riser,"]],[163,["he must have proper habits of sleeping,"]],[165,["he must get up in the morning and be","properly brushed, washed and everything,"]],[170,["and should be what we call a smart man."]],[175,["Now many people believe that if you try","to be very sort of a"]],[183,["person of a fashionable type, I mean that","you wear dresses"]],[188,["of fashionable style and all that – that","will influence others, it’s not true."]],[193,["Because they think you have no conviction","of any kind, you see,"]],[197,["so you must build up an image of yourself","that you are such and such."]],[202,["You see, a kind of a character, as we have","in a drama; it’s a character."]],[207,["The person speaks with the same character,","he talks with the same character."]],[212,["And the style should be absolutely known","to people, that this is your style,"]],[218,["that’s how you are, that you do not sort","of compromise on things."]],[229,["That is very important that when you are","talking to people you must have"]],[234,["a proper style of talking; walking - proper","style."]],[239,["This should be all trimmed down properly,"]],[242,["that you don’t walk in a languid manner,","you see,"]],[245,["in a manner where (you are) throwing your","legs here and there, walking like that,"]],[248,["but straight, and sit down straight."]],[252,["And let people see that you have faith","in yourself, first of all."]],[255,["If you do not have faith in yourself;","I mean, your any behaviour"]],[259,["shows that you have no faith in yourself,","you cannot influence others."]],[263,["So your self-confidence must be shown","through your all behavioural programming,"]],[271,["like talking, sitting, walking,","communicating,"]],[278,["there should be a thing with confidence."]],[282,["But the confidence comes in a person when","he realises that he is completely secured."]],[289,["And in Sahaja Yoga, as you know, that","if your centre heart is secured…"]],[293,["if you know, tell yourself that, “Mother is","with me."]],[295,["Mother is helping me, and I’m with Mother."]],[299,["I’ve nothing to worry”. Then your centre","heart will be alright."]],[302,["Of course, this you cannot tell to others,","but still if you have a personality,"]],[306,["you can imbibe that into others very","simply."]],[310,["But if you are diffident about yourself","then you cannot do it."]],[313,["So confidence is to be established, first","of all, within yourself."]],[319,["For Sahaja Yogis is very easy to say,","“I’m the Spirit,"]],[321,["and I’m the child, I’m the one who has been","chosen by the Adi Shakti Herself.”"]],[327,["So there should be tremendous amount","of confidence in you."]],[337,["Now. Say, for example, when you are, say,","with the people, how do you eat your food?"]],[344,["Some people, you see, open their mouth","all the time;"]],[347,["eat their food with a sort of a sound and","all that. All these things"]],[352,["are watched by others; how you eat,","how you talk."]],[355,["And also, normally, you should not keep","your mouth open."]],[360,["You can never influence people. But keep","your – not pursed either,"]],[363,["but in a normal way – closed, like that,","so that people do not think"]],[369,["that you are just gaping at them, or if","you keep your mouth open all the time."]],[374,["Or they should not think also that you are","aggressive with them or angry with them,"]],[379,["but a normal face, a – what you call –"]],[384,["a face that is neither aggressive, nor which","is subservient. So it won’t give -"]],[391,["supposing you keep a gaping mouth, they’ll","think, “He is an idiot”."]],[394,["And if you keep pursed your lips they","will think"]],[398,["that you are a person of aggressive nature."]],[404,["So one has to understand how you are","sitting before others, talking to others."]],[411,["And to influence others, first of all, as I","said, you must respect your own personality,"]],[416,["and then respect the personality of others","in your behaviour."]],[420,["Like, you see, when somebody comes in,"]],[424,["you should talk to them in a very gentle","manner –"]],[427,["knowing that this is another God who is","coming in."]],[429,["\"If there’s Spirit in me, is Spirit in him","also.\""]],[432,["So you must see that he sits properly,","he is comfortable,"]],[437,["and ask to - if he wants any tea or","anything. Make him comfortable."]],[445,["Let him feel that you are not in any way","disturbed, nor that you are irritated,"]],[451,["but you are very happy to meet him and that","you should settle down with kindness."]],[458,["Sometimes also in diffidence one might feel","nervous about a person if he is there."]],[464,["That nervousness is a sign of insecurity.","One should not be nervous."]],[468,["If you are talking to someone, one should","be in a way that"]],[474,["another person should feel absolutely","confident"]],[478,["and should feel that \"This gentleman is","going to listen to me.\""]],[482,["Now the another way to impress people is:","allow others to talk."]],[487,["Listen to them properly; not talk yourself,","listen to them."]],[491,["And once they have said something, then","say, “That’s true, no doubt."]],[495,["I agree, but…” Then you can start."]],[498,["So you do not just stun them by your,","“No! Not at all!”, like that."]],[503,["But on the contrary, you see what they say."]],[505,["I mean, you can watch Me, I do that","many-a-times."]],[508,["When somebody says, “Oh, true, it’s true,","but, you see, this is it.”"]],[511,["So they don’t mind. They think that you","have seen the other side of the thing also."]],[515,["That you have a balance and you just don’t","impress your ideas on the other."]],[521,["In a way you are, but in a way you do it","that nobody feels that impact,"]],[527,["that you are doing something of that kind.","Now, as far as possible"]],[533,["never tell anybody to do anything.","That hurts people."]],[538,["Say for example, supposing, you people","are there,"]],[541,["I will tell you that, “Do this. Put","the lights on.”"]],[545,["Because after all you are My children, it’s","alright; it’s a different relationship."]],[549,["But when you are dealing with others,","you see, like you should -"]],[553,["somebody is there sitting, if you want","to put on the light, slowly,"]],[558,["while talking, you get up and put on","the light."]],[562,["Ask him: “Would you mind if I put on","the light?” Let him say."]],[567,["But in any behaviourally aggression is","the first impression."]],[572,["Is the other way round in Sahaja Yoga.","In Sahaja Yoga I first raise the Kundalini,"]],[576,["then do this and do that. Is the other way","round it is."]],[578,["You have to build them up from","the foundation"]],[581,["if you have to impress them outside."]],[583,["To build them up from the foundation,","the first is thing is"]],[586,["that you must infuse in them a kind of","a trust in you. They should trust you."]],[594,["They should know that whatever you are","saying is the truth."]],[597,["That you are not telling them something","that is false or you have no faith in it."]],[604,["So in the way you tell them, it influences","them very much"]],[609,["that “Tthis man is telling the truth.”"]],[613,["So the whole thing should start from your","behavioural style, you can say."]],[620,["Now the dress also, I would say - dress is","very important in influencing others."]],[625,["Now supposing you are connected with","somebody in an official way, or in any way,"]],[630,["that you want to influence in the business","and all that."]],[633,["Best thing is to wear a business dress,","not to wear a dress"]],[637,["that is relaxed or casual. No. You must","wear a dress which is a business dress,"]],[645,["you see, like a - you can say, a deep blue","suit with low strips,"]],[651,["and a proper three-piece smart thing,","and a smart, clean shoes,"]],[658,["and hair nicely done, maybe little bit","oiled, it’s alright."]],[664,["Look like a smart business person."]],[668,["But if you try to do the fashions of the","world, you see, then it changes every day."]],[674,["Today the hair will be this side, tomorrow","that side."]],[676,["So make the hairstyle as an official would","do. Is to properly comb the hair."]],[682,["In the olden days, if you see, even","the heroes or anything of the films"]],[689,["used to have oil in their head."]],[691,["They never had this kind of hair which was","dry and this and that."]],[695,["But, I mean, it need not be oil, but should","be properly groomed as they say."]],[700,["There are lots of things available","in the market"]],[702,["which can just groom your hair without","oiling it."]],[705,["So it should be properly groomed hair.","And you should not be something -"]],[709,["so that you show that you have paid","attention to your appearances,"]],[712,["you have paid attention to your hairstyle","and everything."]],[716,["So you make an image out of you which","is absolutely suitable"]],[720,["for a particular type of a job."]],[723,["Now, for a cook, say for example, if cook","dresses up like a,"]],[728,["if you - supposing a cook appears","in a swimsuit –"]],[732,["what do you think of that? It’s horrid!","A cook has to dress up like a cook."]],[736,["In the same way, a businessman also has","to dress up like a businessman."]],[742,["Now you cannot go about in jeans in your","office. You should not,"]],[747,["because if you do it, everybody will do it.","And all these things are creating laxity."]],[752,["Laxity is alright outside the office,"]],[755,["outside your business, alright, but not","where you have the business."]],[760,["Like we have drawing rooms; now drawing","room is a drawing room, it’s not a bedroom."]],[764,["You should not mix them up. Once you start","mixing them up, there’s no end to it."]],[768,["One can go to any limit. I have seen people","going to office"]],[772,["in dresses which really look like","a swimsuit."]],[777,["So this has to be revived,"]],[781,["and can be revived very easily if you","tell people"]],[785,["that you won’t be able to influence people","unless and until you keep"]],[789,["that kind of a form, and an upright","behaviour."]],[796,["In dealing with others is another point,","very important;"]],[800,["that you have to be truthful. Don’t tell","lies."]],[804,["But if you have to tell something, then you","must tell straightforward."]],[809,["But everything need not be told also,"]],[811,["that is not telling lies. Everything need","not be told."]],[814,["Whatever you have to tell you should say;","this much is this, that’s all."]],[818,["But you shouldn’t tell one thing today,"]],[820,["tomorrow another thing, day-after-tomorrow","another thing."]],[823,["That creates a very big gap in the mind","of a human being, unconsciously,"]],[829,["and he thinks, “Oh, he is a cheat,"]],[832,["and he is trying to evade the issue","or something.”"]],[837,["Supposing now I’m talking to you, and then","I start looking at the watch,"]],[842,["then it is insulting."]],[845,["Supposing you are talking about something,","some particular thing,"]],[849,["and then suddenly I change the topic;","then it is again insulting."]],[857,["Because everybody is intelligent to see","that you are trying to avoid the issue."]],[861,["But up to a point you should take it,","and then, the whole thing"]],[865,["if it is ridiculous, you should bring","to a point to show that."]],[868,["Like yesterday, I said that, “You see,","I never wrote about a serpent."]],[871,["If somebody else has written, why should","I explain it?"]],[875,["I never call it a serpent energy, because","that confuses people."]],[879,["But if somebody has called it a serpent","doesn’t matter. What can we do about it?”"]],[883,["And when you say such a thing, you see,","bring it to a ridiculous conclusion"]],[889,["of the whole thing, so the person himself","keeps quiet."]],[893,["But you should not suddenly change","the topic."]],[896,["That means you are evading the issue;","you don’t know how to handle it. You see?"]],[900,["This is something sometimes people,","just while talking, they’ll say,"]],[903,["“Alright, let’s talk about this.” You","cannot."]],[907,["And a diversion in talking like that can","create a big problem."]],[911,["Another is: while talking to others, don’t","talk about yourself;"]],[917,["“I am this and I am (that).” No one likes","that. It’s stupid, to talk about yourself."]],[921,["“I have this thing. I am this thing.”","Nothing!"]],[924,["Now, you just all the time ask, “So what","are you doing?"]],[927,["What is your profession? How are you?”,","this, that; all sorts of questions to him."]],[933,["Now, if he says to anything - then you","have to talk,"]],[937,["say, about your organization, then you","shouldn’t say ‘I’,"]],[940,["you should say ‘we’. You should always","say ‘we’."]],[944,["‘We don’t do it. We are”. ‘We’ means","the organization."]],[947,["You always refer to the organization and","never to yourself."]],[951,["“I would not do such a thing. I hate it.","I believe into it.” It’s absolutely absurd."]],[956,["What you have to do that, “We, we, we","believe… We, we think this way,"]],[960,["and what is your opinion? We have this","kind of a thing.”"]],[966,["Or anything that you want to tell them","about"]],[969,["your own organization or your own product","or anything,"]],[975,["you have to tell them that, “See, this is","what is available to you."]],[980,["Now it is here, and we have seen that","it has done lot of good,"]],[987,["and it works this way. And we have got","very good reports about it."]],[994,["You can see the reports. We have the reports","here. You can see what is it."]],[997,["And, if you please, you can try it, and see","for yourself.”"]],[1003,["The amount of services you give","to the person"]],[1007,["is very much appreciated by another person."]],[1011,["It’s not only ego, but it makes a person","very comfortable."]],[1014,["Like, people would like to travel by Air","India very much."]],[1018,["Many people say they would like to travel","by Air India."]],[1021,["I tried to understand why; because these","days it’s difficult,"]],[1025,["because they examine you too much, and","also because of bombing and this and that."]],[1029,["So I thought that Air India would be","very difficult."]],[1033,["And they have raised the prices of their -","what you call - travel"]],[1039,["because they have to do extra spending on","getting people checked and this and that."]],[1047,["But the reason why people take to Air","India is this -"]],[1051,["the ladies who work there are extremely","modest type."]],[1057,["And they look after the people very well."]],[1060,["They are not cheap, they are not cheap","women;"]],[1063,["and when they serve people, they take","good care."]],[1067,["And the food is lavish, absolutely lavish;","eat as much as you like; a lot of food."]],[1075,["They give you five, six times food,","whatever you like."]],[1078,["And you feel quite happy to have all that."]],[1081,["And the slightest - if you press the button,","immediately they are available to you."]],[1087,["So what I’m saying, when you are really","marketing things,"]],[1090,["you must know you are on the other end."]],[1093,["You are not to be serviced, but you have","to service."]],[1097,["Once you realise that you have to service","others, your attitude changes."]],[1101,["You see, you have to service others. Only","through your services"]],[1105,["they are going to work out. I’ll tell you","how."]],[1108,["Like - specially with the English is a big","problem."]],[1113,["That’s why they are losing so much.","They are extremely arrogant."]],[1116,["If you go to an Englishman and ask him","that,"]],[1121,["“Can I see what product you have?”","“What do you want?!”"]],[1125,["“No, I would like to see the product that","you have.”"]],[1127,["“Alright; we just now don’t have any","arrangements here to give you anything."]],[1131,["But if you leave your note we’ll send you.”","Finished! That fellow is not bothered."]],[1137,["You should be properly equipped all","the time to attend to people."]],[1142,["In the sense, in an organisation… now","supposing you are having some product,"]],[1146,["then you should know all about it.","The brochures should be there."]],[1149,["It’s all the time available whenever","you want it,"]],[1151,["it should be properly priced, systematically","kept."]],[1153,["If somebody comes, if you know the person,","if it has validity,"]],[1157,["you see, he is the one who can do some","business with you, say:"]],[1161,["“Here it is. Please have it. You can see","yourself” - explain to him what it is -"]],[1165,["“And this is what it is, and we can give","you so much concession in that;"]],[1169,["could be this much.” And all those things","are going to capture the market."]],[1174,["The market does not capture - not because","of the product so much,"]],[1178,["but because of the way it is put forward."]],[1182,["The way it is put forward is very","important."]],[1184,["That you have a proper brochure done,","by proper people,"]],[1187,["or you yourself see to it that it’s done","beautifully."]],[1191,["Little money doesn’t matter on that,","that whatever is spent"]],[1194,["is a proper of the capital that you have","to put in for the product; is a part of it."]],[1199,["If you think that just to put a production,","then it won’t sell."]],[1204,["These are part and parcel in modern times","of any product being made or sold."]],[1211,["Is a part of the product. To influence","people you don’t have"]],[1214,["to advertise so much as you have to deal","with them."]],[1218,["I mean, I can tell you this much, that","when I have"]],[1222,["to buy something anywhere I remember","the people"]],[1224,["from whom I bought, and the experiences","I have had."]],[1227,["I think, I would always go to a person who","was kind to Me, nice to Me."]],[1231,["He may take more money, doesn’t matter."]],[1233,["But he is kind to Me; he is not shouting","at Me,"]],[1237,["who is well-behaved and his behavior is","nice"]],[1240,["and he doesn’t just try to make fun of Me;"]],[1244,["and also, on the contrary, gives Me all","the information and everything."]],[1250,["It’s absolutely acceptable."]],[1252,["Like, I went to see Lloyds; there’s","a company I wanted to put some money."]],[1259,["I mean, it’s a very big thing to put some","money in some bank,"]],[1261,["they should understand there’s a customer."]],[1263,["Now, they had put a little girl there.","After all, the people who are to be"]],[1270,["contacting others should be people of","personality. Some little girl was there."]],[1275,["As soon as I went there, then she said,","“Who are you?”, this thing."]],[1278,["I told her, “I am this and this and all","that.” “Oh, no, we can’t have you;"]],[1282,["you have to get this and, please - we can’t","do it.” So I said alright,"]],[1285,["in deference I said alright. I gave the name","of the High Commissioner"]],[1288,["of India and all those things. I mean,","she should understand"]],[1290,["that I would not say like that."]],[1293,["So, the only thing is that she did not","realize that I was with a driver."]],[1301,["I had a chauffeur-driven car. I had","a Mercedes with Me"]],[1305,["and I was wearing an expensive sari.","I looked quite respectable,"]],[1310,["and she should have understood that the way","to behave towards Me is different"]],[1315,["from you would behave for an ordinary","laborer. Here is a real customer."]],[1319,["So she said, “Alright then, I would like","to have your identification,"]],[1326,["then I’ll have to do this, and – no, no,","no, no, no. You fill everything.”"]],[1329,["I got so fed up with her; I went to another;","that is NatWest, I would say."]],[1334,["I mean, I have got a bank somewhere else,"]],[1337,["but I wanted one near My house. Though","it is far, little far away,"]],[1341,["though it is not in such a good locality,","when I entered in, as soon as I went,"]],[1346,["she was an intelligent woman, she could","see that this is a good customer for us."]],[1350,["She could see it from My - I was wearing","diamonds, this, that."]],[1353,["She could see from My personality that","there’s a good customer coming in."]],[1357,["Immediately she said, “Please, let us get","into the VIP room.”"]],[1361,["I didn’t say anything about VIP room."]],[1363,["She went, took Me inside and she talked","very gently to Me,"]],[1366,["and she said ‘Yes’ and she asked Me, and","she said, “Can I take one minute?”"]],[1372,["She went in and she told somebody","to telephone and find out"]],[1376,["about My, this thing and all that, and","she didn’t say."]],[1380,["You see, it is not to be done in","the presence of the person,"]],[1383,["but you can verify the person’s personality","and everything secretly, alright,"]],[1390,["in a way that he doesn’t feel bad","or something,"]],[1393,["and to know that who is this man and is he","correct or not, whether he -"]],[1397,["but he should not know that you are","inquiring."]],[1399,["And you should not in any way show that","you know about him."]],[1405,["So, you see, that kind of a secrecy helps","a lot,"]],[1409,["because you do not become arrogant, you do","not become blunt;"]],[1413,["or you say, blatantly if you tell somebody,","you see, no one likes you that way."]],[1417,["The likes and dislikes come when you insult","another"]],[1421,["or you try to put down another person or","you try to doubt another person."]],[1428,["These are the three things if you look","after -"]],[1431,["that you put the person into a comfortable","position"]],[1434,["and tell him everything; listen to him,","what he has to say; trusting him."]],[1442,["Then the person looks upon you."]],[1447,["So, in an organization, if you have to run","any administration"]],[1450,["and organization, your personality has","to be absolutely sensible."]],[1456,["Secondly, what you talk you must follow."]],[1460,["Supposing I tell you: ”You shouldn’t take","money”,"]],[1462,["and I start grabbing money from you;","supposing – then what will you do?"]],[1467,["You will have no faith in Me, will you?"]],[1473,["I mean, actually, when you give Me money","for pujas"]],[1477,["I keep them in a packet, you see, like","that;"]],[1479,["and use that money for buying the silver","and all that for your… something."]],[1484,["I need not. I mean it’s out of question."]],[1487,["You have given Me in puja, it’s supposed","to be Mine,"]],[1489,["and I’ve said, alright, to keep the protocol","alright,"]],[1491,["you put all this silverware… it is My own,","you see,"]],[1496,["but you can use it. I mean, it’s just","a joke,"]],[1498,["but everybody knows that Mother is so clear","cut, is so clear cut."]],[1503,["You have to be clear cut with people.","They should understand"]],[1505,["that you do not play tricks with them,"]],[1509,["or you are doing some sort of backhand","outwitting or something."]],[1519,["Some people do it, you see, at the back","of a person"]],[1522,["they try some sort of a trick and..."]],[1524,["Such a person is never liked; nobody","respects such a person;"]],[1528,["but straightforward dealing with a person","as he is."]],[1532,["If somebody is not alright, in a mild way","you should say:"]],[1535,["“See, this is the problem is. I’m facing","this problem."]],[1538,["Now you tell me what is the solution”."]],[1542,["And then the person doesn’t feel bad.","If you tell a person"]],[1545,["directly they won’t like it. No, they","won’t."]],[1551,["You won’t like it, I know, if I tell you","something so directly,"]],[1554,["but I tell you everything. But I tell you","in a way that is mild…"]],[1559,["[Aside to Gregoire: “Come along, I’m now","on administration…”]"]],[1566,["… something that is mild, that is","congenial,"]],[1573,["that is easily understood and assimilated."]],[1579,["That is very important, that you must have","a style"]],[1585,["which people understand, and a kind","of a proper behavior."]],[1595,["[Aside to Gregoire: “Just giving them some","lecture on administration,"]],[1598,["and how to influence…”. Gregoire:","“Should I go out or leave?”."]],[1600,["Shri Mataji: “No, no, no, no, it’s for","every one of you”.]"]],[1601,["How to influence others, you see, how to -"]],[1605,["actually by not influencing others, you","influence others."]],[1612,["Art lies in hiding art."]],[1617,["There should be no deliberations exposed","about it."]],[1621,["And if you understand how to do that…","(Hindi conversation aside)"]],[1662,["So, you see, you should (Hindi)"]],[1680,["Now, so, while talking to someone also,"]],[1684,["even if you don’t understand what they","are talking, you should show"]],[1688,["you are understanding them and listening","to what they are telling you;"]],[1691,["also may be absurd, this thing, that thing."]],[1694,["Now, when you have to deal, say, about","with three persons,"]],[1699,["or five persons, or ten persons like, then","you have to understand"]],[1704,["that you should always try to create a good","feeling among them, what you call."]],[1710,["Like supposing now, I would like you","to marry say Mary,"]],[1714,["for example, take a position; then I will","tell you about her,"]],[1720,["what she is, in a way that will not hurt","you, not hurt her, but prepare you."]],[1728,["Because later on you may hear about her","that somebody was saying so,"]],[1732,["and Mother never told you. So in a way,","in a very gentle way you should say,"]],[1738,["“You see, she has little of this thing, but","it’s alright,"]],[1742,["she can be very, very gentle, you can","manage it."]],[1748,["And it depends on you, how you manage it.”","And then - so that he feels informed,"]],[1756,["knowledgeable about a person, and also","responsible about it,"]],[1760,["that “Now it’s my responsibility.”"]],[1765,["So, to make people responsible is also","a very important part of administration."]],[1770,["If you start doing every work yourself,"]],[1773,["then people will never share your work,","you see. They will never do anything."]],[1778,["Now to make them responsible, the best","way is by rewarding them."]],[1785,["You must reward them if somebody has done","a good work."]],[1788,["“Oh, you’ve done such a good work.”","But not directly like that;"]],[1793,["in a very indirect manner, very indirect","manner you must reward that person."]],[1797,["Not only in words, but in kind words –","you can do it in kind, small things."]],[1802,["You see, like, I’ll tell you an example","of Rajesh."]],[1806,["Rajesh is very sweet, and he doesn’t need","anything."]],[1808,["I mean, he is such a rich man, and what","can we give him?"]],[1812,["But once he, what - he had taken Me","somewhere"]],[1814,["and he had these Swiss knives, see, Swiss","penknife, and he gave it to the driver"]],[1822,["to cut the fruit or something. And then","it vanished."]],[1825,["You see, he got very angry, you see, with","him because he couldn’t bear this fellow"]],[1828,["cheating him like this. We took him","to the police station and all that,"]],[1832,["but he couldn’t get it. The driver had","managed it, you see."]],[1835,["It was a taxi. So he was very angry with","the driver."]],[1838,["So I saw that, I said, “Let it be. It’s","alright, doesn’t matter.”"]],[1842,["Next time when I went to India, I took","a very nice knife for him."]],[1845,["When he saw it, he just melted away.","He said, “Mother, how did You remember?”"]],[1849,["I said, “You were so upset at that time!”","He said,"]],[1852,["“Not because of the knife as such, but","because of the way this fellow cheated me.”"]],[1856,["But the whole thing neutralized, you see,","and he was…"]],[1859,["So, little, little things if you watch","of a person, it’s very sweet."]],[1865,["Like I’ll tell you about Gregoire; once we","went to a shop"]],[1868,["to buy some saris, you see, for Myself","I was buying some saris."]],[1872,["And I thought, “I’ve bought quite a lot","now.” And I liked one sari very, very much,"]],[1877,["but I didn’t buy it. I thought it was too","much money,"]],[1879,["I shouldn’t waste all this money, it will","not be needed"]],[1881,["and whatever it is – I gave it up."]],[1884,["And next day Gregoire bought that sari","as a present to Me,"]],[1888,["and really I treasured that sari.","I remember…"]],[1891,["You see, every incident can be made","into some sort of a very valid thing."]],[1897,["You can say kind of like a puja we can","call it;"]],[1900,["but like a very valid thing that: “Oh,","this was…”"]],[1903,["So all these things make a difference in","an organization where you are working."]],[1909,["Little, little things like that. Also they","should feel"]],[1912,["that you are responsible for them in","an organization, very important."]],[1916,["I’ll say, like once in My husband’s office"]],[1923,["you see, one fellow joined another","organization."]],[1926,["And he told not to join another","organization,"]],[1929,["but he joined it because there was more","money."]],[1931,["And when he went there he found it was","all a very horrible thing."]],[1935,["There was nothing good happening only","except for the money,"]],[1938,["he was very unhappy there, so he wanted","to come back."]],[1941,["When he came back – you see, My husband","was very annoyed."]],[1946,["He said, “I told you not to go there.","Why did you go?"]],[1948,["And, what was the need to do such a thing?","Now I cannot take you back.”"]],[1956,["So the fellow came to Me. I don’t know","why he thought of it, but he came to Me."]],[1961,["He told Me: “This is what has happened but","I want to come back to shipping corporation,"]],[1966,["and I’ve made some mistakes. I think","I’ve made a big mistake."]],[1970,["But Mr. Shrivastava is somehow or other","is angry with me."]],[1972,["He doesn’t want to take me back.”"]],[1974,["So when Mr. Shrivastava came home I said","that he came to see Me."]],[1978,["“Oh! So he came to see you – as if you are","my boss!”. And, you see, he got very angry."]],[1982,["So I said, “He wants to join your","organisation."]],[1985,["I think you should give a consideration to","him.” He said, “Why did he come to you?”"]],[1990,["“I think - I said - he thought I’m more","forgiving than you are, perhaps”."]],[1994,["That put him right. He said, “What do you","mean?"]],[1997,["I can be forgiving too.” “So then forgive","him!”"]],[2004,["These are the tricks, you see, which I have","natural, but you can imbibe also."]],[2008,["Not difficult to impress others, you see."]],[2012,["Such little, little things make","a difference, you see."]],[2017,["When they are sick you must look after","them."]],[2020,["Find out if their children are sick,","if their wives are sick."]],[2027,["You should be concerned and you should","be identified."]],[2030,["In an organization you must treat it like","a family; absolutely like a family."]],[2034,["“What’s wrong with her? Is she all right?"]],[2036,["Do you need any help?”, this thing,","that thing."]],[2038,["Send sometimes the flowers if the husband","is sick, or wife is sick,"]],[2042,["or about the children make enquiries.","All these things mean a lot."]],[2047,["But while - normally people what they do,"]],[2052,["on a Christmas Day at the most they might","send a card or something."]],[2056,["But you can have in the organization","a proper card system."]],[2059,["You should sign them at hand (unclear)","yourself, and one line somewhere"]],[2063,["if you know something: “I hope your wife is","alright. I hope the children are alright”."]],[2068,["If you know the wife: “Please convey","my regards to her”."]],[2071,["There’s no need to make them drink like","fish, but it’s more to make them feel"]],[2075,["that they are loved and they are liked","in the organization,"]],[2079,["they are very important, this kind","of thing."]],[2082,["Even the suggestion, like say, you see,","changing a position of a person;"]],[2085,["now, supposing, now if I want now Christine","to be the leader in America"]],[2091,["and Gregoire to be the – to be there,","to have you,"]],[2094,["but not to interfere with Christine,"]],[2096,["I said: “Gregoire, see now, she is there,","she is handling people better,"]],[2099,["she knows them, people have love and","respect."]],[2102,["Suddenly you are a new person going there."]],[2104,["So I don’t want - and you will be her","husband -"]],[2106,["so, as it is you are one of the world","leaders, you see,"]],[2110,["and you should have nothing to do with","the local stuff, you see.” He understood it."]],[2115,["But had I said, “You don’t talk anything","there! Now you keep quiet!”"]],[2118,["I mean, it would not have worked out."]],[2124,["And that he is, he knows that very well.","That he is that way one of the world leaders"]],[2128,["and we have Warren like that. Some of you","have come up like that,"]],[2131,["that anywhere in the whole world you can","go and do anything you like."]],[2134,["Like I would say Rajesh is another one who","is coming up."]],[2139,["But unless and until you make proper","arrangements"]],[2146,["you should not shift a person suddenly.","See, you should try"]],[2150,["to see that this person suddenly shifted","won’t be alright."]],[2155,["But you must also find out if you really","want to shift"]],[2160,["a person or not. If you are uncertain,","better keep it hanging."]],[2163,["You see, time is the best way to allow","things to happen like this, you see."]],[2167,["Allow little time to pass away. Give","a little hint to a person,"]],[2170,["“You see, people are complaining. What","to do? I’d like you to help me out, like.”"]],[2175,["So that he also thinks that you’ve given","him the sufficient time to improve."]],[2180,["You know, that way. But if you don’t give","any time"]],[2183,["and you just tell a person: “Now, you get","out!”, he’ll become your enemy."]],[2189,["But, on the contrary, you should say,","“I’m sorry, but these people are such,"]],[2192,["they are trying to, you see, trouble us","and trouble me all the time,"]],[2197,["and I don’t know what’s wrong with them,","but, see, please take care and all that.”"]],[2201,["And things work out. People take it,","you see, they understand"]],[2204,["that you are responsible for yourself,"]],[2206,["and that I am putting that responsibility","on them."]],[2210,["That is how it should be worked out."]],[2212,["There’s a shop in Lucknow and he makes","very good sweets,"]],[2215,["very famous for its sweets, you see.","And now his father is gone"]],[2219,["but the son is sitting with his big stomach","he has got there, he is sitting there."]],[2223,["And everybody goes there to his shop","to buy."]],[2226,["And you cannot take a car; you have to walk","quite a long distance."]],[2229,["Now his trick is such, which I have noticed","that."]],[2232,["What he will do that he will take your","first order, then you said,"]],[2237,["“Alright, please this”. Then you are sitting","there. Then he’ll say, “What are you doing?"]],[2242,["Why don’t you give her things? She has","been sitting for such a long time.”"]],[2246,["He’ll tell Me: “Look at these people, you","see. They just go on taking"]],[2250,["so much time of people. Now I hope you","don’t have to go by the airplane just now.”"]],[2255,["I said, “No, no. I’m alright, it’s alright.”","So, on an apology all the time, you see."]],[2259,["So then he’ll say: “Why not taste some of","these things I’ve made specially, just try.”"]],[2264,["So you eat something; “Alright, give me","this also more” -"]],[2267,["like that he goes on, you see, giving time.","And then, after some time,"]],[2272,["again he’ll say: “Oh now, look at these","people, how horrid they are."]],[2275,["They don’t know how to finish the work."]],[2278,["Hey! What are you doing there? Why don’t","you give some, Her sweets to the lady?"]],[2281,["She has to go now. Why are you taking","so much time?"]],[2284,["I’m sorry, but will you taste this till","then, they’ll bring it”."]],[2287,["So he gives something else. So you say:","“Alright, give me this”."]],[2290,["By the time you go from there all your","money is finished"]],[2292,["and you have bought all the sweets","of the shop! And that’s the trick he plays."]],[2297,["And it’s - then after some time you","discover it that, and you say that,"]],[2301,["“I know all these tricks. Now, will you","please give Me whatever I want"]],[2303,["and I’ll leave!”"]],[2306,["So what I’m saying that a relationship","of sweetness and this thing develops"]],[2311,["when you see that a person how sweetly","he is selling his things, products to us."]],[2316,["On the contrary: “This is my product."]],[2319,["If you want you have it. Otherwise, get","out!” “Yes, alright, you get out first”."]],[2325,["The whole attitude of selling is now","turning back"]],[2330,["to a proper relationship between the person","who wants to sell -"]],[2335,["seller - and the purchaser."]],[2338,["It’s just the relationship that works, not","the product."]],[2341,["Let the product go to hell! Nobody is","bothered about the product."]],[2347,["Of course, I mean, if you just cheat them","is alright,"]],[2350,["but between A, B, C, D, E – if you have","five products,"]],[2354,["people will take - and they are equally","about the same, equally good -"]],[2360,["then people will go to the organization","which is sensible,"]],[2365,["which receives people sensibly, respects","them"]],[2368,["and delivers the thing in time, and a thing","that is not so useless."]],[2379,["Of course, you must find out what is","the good in the other organizations,"]],[2383,["what they are having, and what they are","selling. You should find out."]],[2387,["That is important. And why people like","that."]],[2390,["But mostly I’ve seen what works out","is nothing"]],[2393,["but your relationship with the customer."]],[2397,["But also your relationship in the office","should be good."]],[2401,["That’s both the things should work out.","The relationship must be good."]],[2405,["First of all your personality should be","good. I was telling him, you see,"]],[2408,["people who wear the fashionable dresses","in the office, you see,"]],[2411,["cannot be good administrators, cannot.","Because, you see, they become little loose,"]],[2418,["and people start taking advantage","of a loose personality."]],[2422,["But you should be tight, in the sense -","wear an official dress, always, you know."]],[2428,["People have an awe about that."]],[2431,["I was telling him, supposing a cook wears,","a lady cook wears"]],[2434,["a swimming dress: no one will like it,","will they?"]],[2440,["In the same way, this new idea, like you","see now, in the offices"]],[2446,["people will call the… everybody, the driver","will call the boss: “Tom, how are you?”."]],[2452,["Then no respect, it starts like that."]],[2456,["Or if the boss takes, say, drugs or","something,"]],[2459,["like in India they take what you call","tobacco. Is a tobacco they eat."]],[2463,["So what happens, that even a peon goes","to the boss"]],[2474,["and the boss says, “Have you got little","bit of …?”. “Yes, yes, yes.”"]],[2479,["So he takes out his own and gives it.","Finished!"]],[2482,["The whole relationship is finished."]],[2484,["So at that time, if you’re taking drugs, if","you have – if you take drinks or anything,"]],[2492,["whatever habits you have are really","detrimental, but try to cut them."]],[2497,["But even if you cannot, you do not expect","your subordinates to support that."]],[2504,["No one likes cheap type of jokes and","things, but, you see, these subordinates"]],[2508,["they pass a cheap type of jokes and they","think they are popular."]],[2510,["They are not. Popularity is to be gained","by aloofness"]],[2516,["and singleness. Not by just becoming","like them."]],[2520,["Like, another incident I’ll give you that"]],[2525,["in CP’s office there was a lady who","came in a jeans, you see."]],[2528,["And CP called her. He said, “Madam,","I will not have this."]],[2533,["You can wear trousers, or you can wear","something, sensible dress,"]],[2536,["but not these jeans.” She said, “No,","but sir, now these days it’s good.”"]],[2539,["He said, “Yes, it’s alright. You can wear","it on the streets. You can wear it"]],[2542,["in the house. You can wear it anywhere –","but not in the office.”"]],[2545,["She said, “No sir, it cannot be so”.","He said, “Alright,"]],[2548,["then will you please resign. I won’t have","you.”"]],[2552,["Then she started wearing proper dresses."]],[2554,["Because that really makes a difference,","you see."]],[2557,["Always a dress makes a difference for","proper articulation."]],[2564,["Absolutely you see that. Now, yesterday","I didn’t have a white sari. Just imagine!"]],[2568,["They never put any white saris for My","programme."]],[2572,["So, I said: “Now, I always wear a white","sari for My programme”."]],[2575,["But I had one, this one, the white with","the red border. It makes a difference."]],[2580,["If I had worn some other sari it could","not happen."]],[2582,["But supposing I am coming to see you, what","sari I wear has an effect on you."]],[2586,["“Oh, Mother wore this sari while coming,","you see, just to meet us.”"]],[2591,["It’s like your light; you see, your dress,","your behaviour"]],[2594,["is like your light, whatever you are inside","shows out with that."]],[2599,["And all these compromises that people","are having nowadays"]],[2602,["is spoiling the administration."]],[2605,["You must keep to yourself; you must keep","to your position."]],[2609,["Like, now there are, in the offices I’ve","seen, people answer back, you see."]],[2615,["Your own people will sit down and answer","back."]],[2618,["But if you see a Japanese firm, one person","will speak, nobody else."]],[2622,["They’ll all sit tight. When this one person","asks him a question,"]],[2625,["he says, otherwise he doesn’t speak."]],[2627,["A kind of an absolutely unison exists","between them."]],[2631,["Now what they do – the trick is like this –","before going to any programme"]],[2636,["and all that, he’ll call all his five","people,"]],[2638,["“This is what we are going to discuss","there."]],[2640,["Now you have to say this and you have","to say this."]],[2643,["And when I ask you this, you have","to say this.”"]],[2645,["It’s already decided. Nobody is free","to talk in the presence of others."]],[2649,["All the freedom is before, you see, before","going."]],[2651,["We do the same with our children. When","Indians have to go"]],[2654,["to somebody’s house, now, they’ll tell","the children, “When you go there,"]],[2658,["you are not to ask for anything. You should","not touch anything there."]],[2662,["You are not to eat much. I’ll say no","to that."]],[2667,["And even if you have to eat, take very","little."]],[2670,["And then, before going, you must say;","“Thank you”."]],[2673,["When you go there you must say, “Namaskar.”"]],[2675,["All these things are taught in the house,","first of all."]],[2677,["“Otherwise next time we’ll not take you!”"]],[2685,["So by that thing, you see, what happens","that they are already warned."]],[2690,["Actually they are knowledgeable what to do."]],[2692,["Supposing you take five people, come along","for a meeting, sit down there."]],[2695,["Then they start arguing among themselves,","in the same organization they do."]],[2700,["Now, for example, now, Sahaja Yogis"]],[2702,["in the beginning used to do the same.","I have seen that."]],[2705,["They would argue with Me in the presence","of others and it created a problem."]],[2708,["So I had to tell them: “Now in the presence","of others don’t argue."]],[2716,["If you want to tell Me, you tell Me”."]],[2719,["And between them to create a good feeling,","you see, no sense of jealousies or anything."]],[2724,["The jealousy is another thing that plays","very much among your own people."]],[2728,["So you just have to tell that, “Everybody","has their own job."]],[2730,["Everything has to be done, and is to be","done well –"]],[2733,["and we are all together; we are one."]],[2736,["There’s no question of having this hand","having a jealousy with this hand,"]],[2739,["but you are on the left hand, you are","on the right hand. Alright,"]],[2741,["do your right-hand work and you do your","left-hand work"]],[2744,["and the whole thing will work out.","The whole organization has to come up."]],[2747,["If the organization goes up, we’ll all get","the advantages.”"]],[2750,["So always build them up into a unison","as far the organization is concerned."]],[2756,["“If we all work out well, if we have more","profits, we’ll have better bonuses”."]],[2764,["So…","[Tape interruption]"]],[2767,["…innately perhaps maybe I understand","your Kundalinis very well."]],[2774,["Innately I know how to deal with people;","innately."]],[2779,["Now, sometimes you have to say about","someone –"]],[2782,["say, I may say about you to him, that, you","see, “Look after him and do this and…”"]],[2788,["Maybe he is rather careless. He won’t","understand"]],[2790,["what I’ve told and he might just say,","“Mother was saying so!”"]],[2793,["So I have to warn him: “You just say","yourself."]],[2797,["Otherwise it won’t have any effect."]],[2799,["If I have to tell him, I can tell him","directly. Why I’m telling you?”"]],[2805,["But all these things must be made clear","before he speaks."]],[2808,["Because once he’s done it, then what’s","the use?"]],[2812,["Then, if he comes to your explanation","to you,"]],[2815,["you should be prepared to say, tell him","why you had to tell him,"]],[2820,["and I didn’t tell you directly. So that","the another person who has tried"]],[2824,["to be stupid is put into his own place;","and your relations remain alright."]],[2830,["So relationships are to be maintained good","by your own dignity,"]],[2837,["your own sense of respect of yourself,","and the respect of others."]],[2843,["You see, as you treat yourself, you treat","others."]],[2845,["But first you have no respect for yourself,","how can you respect others?"]],[2850,["And I personally think that, you see,","this fashion business -"]],[2854,["that this is very fashionable, that is very","fashionable - is a beggarish stuff."]],[2858,["You see, it’s beggarish. Is the beggars","who create the fashion in democracy."]],[2863,["Democratic countries, you see, another","I’ve found out,"]],[2866,["is a left-sided stuff. And when they create","a fashion, what happens?"]],[2872,["That, say, there are ten beggars who have","nothing,"]],[2876,["so what - the ten people start wearing","a dress like that,"]],[2879,["and even a rich man will start behaving","like that."]],[2882,["So, it is in the same way, there are ten","stupid fools, you see,"]],[2886,["idiots, they behave like idiots,"]],[2888,["so even an intelligent man thinks something","wrong with him."]],[2891,["So in a democracy you have to be like","the rest of them,"]],[2894,["so you start behaving like an idiot.","Yes, it’s true!"]],[2899,["I mean, like I have seen some very senior","people, sensible people"]],[2904,["cracking very dirty jokes. And the reason","is, you see, when they came to England"]],[2909,["they found everybody talking like that."]],[2912,["So they thought: “Am I something different","with me? Oh, I’m also like you.”"]],[2915,["So they will crack a joke. So they stoop","down, you see."]],[2919,["You don’t have to stoop down, you have","to rise higher to attract them."]],[2923,["This is the difference: to stoop down","to their level or to rise higher."]],[2927,["But, while rising higher, you should not","suggest that you are rising higher,"]],[2931,["create any jealousy, or kind of a feeling","that this one thinks no end of himself."]],[2936,["But in a very gentle manner you should","show that you are higher than them;"]],[2942,["then only they will follow you. Otherwise","they will not."]],[2944,["If you are lower than them, or of their","style, how, why will they follow?"]],[2948,["Many people do these things, I mean,","such a common thing in the West;"]],[2952,["see, they have lost their sense at all.","But in other countries, like say,"]],[2956,["any country which is a fascist country,"]],[2958,["or a, say, a Communist country, where","they are right-sided,"]],[2961,["what they do, they build up their own","images."]],[2964,["I would say, even in Japan is the same.","They have their own images."]],[2967,["The leader is a leader, you see, you","cannot talk to him."]],[2970,["If you have to talk to him, you have","to talk in this manner;"]],[2973,["there’s a system of that kind, and you","cannot behave like this."]],[2977,["But the leader himself has a projection","of a personality,"]],[2982,["where he treats everyone like a father,","father."]],[2985,["But here the father behaves like a child."]],[2987,["The child comes and says: “I want some","drink.”"]],[2990,["So the father pours some whisky and gives","it to his son. Finished!"]],[2995,["That relationship is finished."]],[2997,["As soon as you try to come to the level","of your child - is finished."]],[3003,["They must know, there should be an awe.","That’s a part you have to play."]],[3008,["You should be very friendly, you should be","kind, you should be everything."]],[3011,["But you must know you are a father","out and out."]],[3014,["Otherwise children will never respect you."]],[3015,["In the same way, in any organization","it happens."]],[3019,["You must keep that distance. For example,"]],[3022,["I would never like anybody to call Me","by name, at all, never."]],[3026,["But in the office or something I don’t like","someone to call Me by name,"]],[3031,["so I’ll call others, say, in an office or so,","I’ll say ‘Mister’."]],[3039,["CP’s driver also I’ll say ‘Mister’ to him.","So he dare not call Me by name."]],[3047,["Yogi: Yes, at school it’s become a fashion","that the students call me with my name."]],[3054,["Shri Mataji: That’s it! They have no","respect. They have no respect."]],[3061,["Yogi: All teachers, I mean."]],[3069,["Yogi 2: Shall I go and take a look","downstairs and see whether the bell…"]],[3074,["Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon? Is there","somebody who has come?"]],[3078,["Yogi 2: Well, I heard the bell ringing.","Shri Mataji: Alright, go and have a look."]],[3081,["Then I’ll go and see. It’s eleven o’clock","now, exactly."]],[3084,["Now let Gregoire listen to the first part","of it."]],[3088,["Let’s see what he has to say."]]]);
